🔢 Sum of Digits of a Number

A beginner-friendly Python program that calculates the sum of all digits of a number using mathematical operations instead of converting the number into a string.
The program also handles negative numbers and allows the user to calculate the sum for multiple numbers until they enter q to quit.


📌 Features
🔢 Accepts a number from the user
➕ Calculates the sum of its digits
🧮 Uses mathematical digit extraction
➖ Handles negative numbers using abs()
🔄 Supports multiple calculations
🚪 Allows the user to quit by entering q
🚫 Does not convert the number to a string for digit calculation


